  "open1": {
    "name": "",
    "text": "......",
    "display_mode": "fullscreen",
    "next": "open2"
  },
  "open2": {
    "name": "",
    "text": "水、全都是水。",
    "display_mode": "fullscreen",
    "next": "open2.5"
  },
  "open2.5": {
    "name": "",
    "text": "Rice几乎全身都被埋在水下，[br]享受着液体充斥全身的安心感。",
    "display_mode": "fullscreen",
    "next": "open3"
  },
  "open3": {
    "name": "",
    "text": "这窒息感……[br]是死亡的拥抱？[br]亦或是逃避现实的温柔乡？",
    "display_mode": "fullscreen",
    "next": "open3.5"
  },
  "open3.5": {
    "name": "",
    "text": "并不是身处陌生环境时的恐惧，[br]而确确实实是安然——[br]像是盖着被子一样。",
    "display_mode": "fullscreen",
    "next": "open4"
  },
  "open4": {
    "name": "",
    "text": "灯就在头顶上，[br]他甚至抬头看水面因灯光而更明显的波澜，[br]一圈圈、一点点。",
    "display_mode": "fullscreen",
    "next": "open4.5"
  },
  "open4.5": {
    "name": "",
    "text": "理想中的窒息感——[br]Rice所渴望的窒息感像是潮水般涌来，[br]好似能带给他快感。",
    "display_mode": "fullscreen",
    "next": "open4.7"
  },
  "open4.7": {
    "name": "",
    "text": "他无法呼吸，不只是现在，[br]至少，当他看到Jack那冰冷的眼神时，[br]就早已经无法呼吸了。",
    "display_mode": "fullscreen",
    "next": "open5"
  },
  "open5": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "......[br][m]（好冷……好困……）[/m]",
    "background": "bubbles.png",
    "next": "open5.3"
  },
  "open5.3": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "[m]（身体好重……像被什么东西拽着往下……）[/m]",
    "background": "bubbles.png",
    "next": "open5.5"
  },
  "open5.5": {
    "name": "",
    "text": "嘴边冒出的气泡撩人般扫过脸颊，[br]窒息感愈发强烈……",
    "background": "bubbles.png",
    "display_mode": "fullscreen",
    "next": "open6"
  },
  "open6": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "[m]（也许自己早就该死在这里了……）[/m]",
    "background": "bubbles.png",
    "next": "open6.3"
  },
  "open6.3": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "[m]（只要我死了就好了吧……）[/m]",
    "background": "bubbles.png",
    "next": "open6.5"
  },
  "open6.5": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "[m]（这样就不会再给任何人添麻烦了……）[/m]",
    "background": "bubbles.png",
    "next": "open7"
  },
  "open7": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "[m]（这样，哥哥就再也不用面对我这个累赘了……）[/m]",
    "background": "bubbles.png",
    "next": "open7.3"
  },
  "open7.3": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "[m]（上一次这样安心……是什么时候？）[/m]",
    "background": "bubbles.png",
    "next": "open7.5"
  },
  "open7.5": {
    "name": "",
    "text": "记忆中闪过一个画面——[br]Jack曾经温柔地摸着他的头，[br]说：「Rice，哥哥在。」",
    "background": "bubbles.png",
    "next": "open7.6"
  },
  "open7.6": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "[m]（那时候的哥哥……还会对我笑……）[/m]",
    "background": "bubbles.png",
    "next": "open7.7"
  },
  "open7.7": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "[m]（可现在……他连看都不愿看我了。）[/m]",
    "background": "bubbles.png",
    "change_values": {
      "selfhate": {
        "add": 5
      }
    },
    "next": "open7.8"
  },
  "open7.8": {
    "name": "",
    "text": "水泡从嘴边溢出，向上飘去。[br]像眼泪一样，消失在黑暗的水面上。",
    "background": "bubbles.png",
    "display_mode": "fullscreen",
    "next": "open7.9"
  },
  "open7.9": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "[m]（就这样结束吧……）[/m]",
    "background": "bubbles.png",
    "display_mode": "fullscreen",
    "next": "1t1"
  },
  "character1-fsc": {
    "name": "",
    "text": "C  h  a  r  a  c  t  e  r  [br]0  1  [br]失  落",
    "display_mode": "fullscreen",
    "next": "c1-1"
  },
  "c1-1": {
    "name": "",
    "text": "水下的世界，对于Rice来说，[br]既是绝望的深渊，也是渴望已久的安宁。[br]——至少比现在这个处境好。",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-2"
  },
  "c1-2": {
    "name": "",
    "text": "[y]医院[/y]。",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-3"
  },
  "c1-3": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "[m]（我……我还活着？）[/m]",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-3.2"
  },
  "c1-3.2": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "[m]（为什么……要救我……）[/m]",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-3.3"
  },
  "c1-3.3": {
    "name": "",
    "text": "喉咙里涌上来的咸腥与铁锈味[br]提醒着他的存在、[br]证明着他的一无是处。",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-3.5"
  },
  "c1-3.5": {
    "name": "",
    "text": "再醒来的时候，[br]没有了臆想中的安心感，[br]也不再有水围绕在自己身边，[br]只剩下医院里刺鼻的消毒水味……",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-3.6"
  },
  "c1-3.6": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "[m]（是血的味道吗……还是我嘴里的？）[/m]",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-3.7"
  },
  "c1-3.7": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "[m]（喉咙好痛……像被火烧过一样……）[/m]",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-4"
  },
  "c1-4": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "[m]（……为什么？）[/m]",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-4.5"
  },
  "c1-4.5": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "[m]（为什么连死都这么难……）[/m]",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "change_values": {
      "selfhate": {
        "add": 3
      }
    },
    "next": "c1-5"
  },
  "c1-5": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "[i]*缓慢地坐起*[/i][br][m]（头好痛……全身都在痛……）[/m]",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-5.5"
  },
  "c1-5.5": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "[m]（身体像被拆开又重组一样……）[/m]",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-6"
  },
  "c1-6": {
    "name": "",
    "text": "医院的白色墙壁和冰冷的器械发出的寒光，[br]无情地刺痛着Rice的每一寸感官。",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-6.3"
  },
  "c1-6.3": {
    "name": "",
    "text": "或许是清醒的痛楚，[br]或许是对生的绝望。",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-6.5"
  },
  "c1-6.5": {
    "name": "",
    "text": "点滴瓶里的液体一滴一滴落下，[br]像在倒数着什么。[br]是生命？还是希望？",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-7"
  },
  "c1-7": {
    "name": "",
    "text": "水下的世界似乎比这里更加温暖。[br]至少，那里没有刺鼻的消毒水味[br]和令人[b]窒息[/b]的寂静。",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-7.3"
  },
  "c1-7.3": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "[m]（好想回到水里……）[/m]",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-7.5"
  },
  "c1-7.5": {
    "name": "",
    "text": "……还有一道冷锐的目光，[br]似乎要将自己刺穿。",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-8"
  },
  "c1-8": {
    "name": "Jack",
    "text": "……",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-8.3"
  },
  "c1-8.3": {
    "name": "",
    "text": "那个声音很轻，几乎被点滴声掩盖。[br]但Rice还是听到了。",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-9"
  },
  "c1-9": {
    "name": "",
    "text": "不知何时，或许一直都是，[br]Jack靠在病房的墙上，冷漠地盯着Rice。",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-9.3"
  },
  "c1-9.3": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "[m]（哥哥……什么时候在那里的？）[/m]",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-9.5"
  },
  "c1-9.5": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "[m]（他的眼神……好冷……）[/m]",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-10"
  },
  "c1-10": {
    "name": "",
    "text": "空气中弥漫着压抑的气氛，[br]Jack的目光如同冰霜一般，[br]刺穿了Rice脆弱的外壳。",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-10.3"
  },
  "c1-10.3": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "[m]（好难受……呼吸不过来了……）[/m]",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-10.5"
  },
  "c1-10.5": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "[m]（就像在水里一样……）[/m]",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-11"
  },
  "c1-11": {
    "name": "Jack",
    "text": "Rice。",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "options": [
      {
        "text": "哥……哥哥？",
        "next": "c1-12a"
      },
      {
        "text": "我怎么还活着？",
        "next": "c1-12b"
      },
      {
        "text": "[沉默地移开视线]",
        "next": "c1-12c"
      },
      {
        "text": "[低头看着被单] 对不起……",
        "next": "c1-12d"
      }
    ]
  },
  "c1-12a": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "哥……哥哥？",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-12a-1"
  },
  "c1-12a-1": {
    "name": "Jack",
    "text": "……别叫我哥。",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-12a-2"
  },
  "c1-12a-2": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "[m]（连哥哥都不让我叫了吗……）[/m]",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-13"
  },
  "c1-12b": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "我怎么……还活着？",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "change_values": {
      "selfhate": {
        "add": 5
      },
      "fvblty": {
        "sub": 3
      }
    },
    "next": "c1-12b-1"
  },
  "c1-12b-1": {
    "name": "Jack",
    "text": "你就……这么想死，是吗？",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-12b-2"
  },
  "c1-12b-2": {
    "name": "Jack",
    "text": "……还是说，你只是觉得我……[br][i]*突然顿住*[/i]",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-12b-3"
  },
  "c1-12b-3": {
    "name": "",
    "text": "Jack没说完他的话。[br]不知道他是什么想法，但是，Rice知道，[br]——哥哥有话要说。",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "options": [
      {
        "text": "……我不是那个意思。",
        "next": "c1-12b-a"
      },
      {
        "text": "*沉默*",
        "next": "c1-12b-b"
      },
      {
        "text": "[小声] 对不起……",
        "next": "c1-12b-c"
      },
      {
        "text": "[哽咽] 我只是……不想再拖累你了……",
        "next": "c1-12b-d"
      }
    ]
  },
  "c1-12c": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "[i]*沉默地移开视线*[/i]",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-12c-1"
  },
  "c1-12c-1": {
    "name": "",
    "text": "令人窒息的沉默在两人之间蔓延。[br]Rice能感受到Jack的视线像针一样刺在背上。",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-12c-2"
  },
  "c1-12c-2": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "[m]（好想消失……）[/m]",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-13"
  },
  "c1-12d": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "[低头看着被单] 对不起……",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "change_values": {
      "selfhate": {
        "add": 8
      }
    },
    "next": "c1-12d-1"
  },
  "c1-12d-1": {
    "name": "Jack",
    "text": "……",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "change_values": {
      "Jackselfhate": {
        "add": 5
      }
    },
    "next": "c1-12d-2"
  },
  "c1-12d-2": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "[m]（我又让哥哥失望了……）[/m]",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-13"
  },
  "c1-12b-a": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "……我不是那个……",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-12b-a-1"
  },
  "c1-12b-a-1": {
    "name": "",
    "text": "Rice话音未落，Jack就打断了他。",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-13"
  },
  "c1-12b-b": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "[i]*沉默*[/i]",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-12b-b-1"
  },
  "c1-12b-b-1": {
    "name": "",
    "text": "两人之间的氛围再次变得沉默，[br]似乎隔阂又加重了。",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "change_values": {
      "fvblty": {
        "sub": 3
      }
    },
    "next": "c1-13"
  },
  "c1-12b-c": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "[小声] 对不起……",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "change_values": {
      "selfhate": {
        "add": 8
      }
    },
    "next": "c1-12b-c-1"
  },
  "c1-12b-c-1": {
    "name": "Jack",
    "text": "……",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "change_values": {
      "Jackselfhate": {
        "add": 5
      }
    },
    "next": "c1-13"
  },
  "c1-12b-d": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "[哽咽] 我只是……不想再拖累你了……",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "change_values": {
      "selfhate": {
        "add": 10
      },
      "Jackselfhate": {
        "add": 8
      }
    },
    "next": "c1-12b-d-1"
  },
  "c1-12b-d-1": {
    "name": "Jack",
    "text": "[i]*表情明显动摇了一下*[/i]",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-13"
  },
  "c1-13": {
    "name": "Jack",
    "text": "……我没时间跟你玩[g]过家家[/g]。",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "sound": "typing.wav",
    "conditional_next": [
      {
        "conditions": {
          "fvblty": {
            "lte": 45
          }
        },
        "next": "c1-13-more"
      }
    ],
    "next": "c1-14"
  },
  "c1-13-more": {
    "name": "Jack",
    "text": "……[br][i]*摔门而去*[/i]",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "change_values": {
      "Jack_leave": true
    },
    "next": "c1-14"
  },
  "c1-14": {
    "name": "",
    "text": "病房里再次回归寂寞。[br]Rice身上仍然还是湿湿的，可是他不在乎。[br]房间里的气压已经低到极点。",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "conditional_next": [
      {
        "conditions": {
          "Jack_leave": {
            "eq": true
          }
        },
        "next": "c1-14.3"
      }
    ],
    "next": "c1-15-b"
  },
  "c1-14.3": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "[m]（又剩下我一个人了……）[/m]",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-15-a"
  },
  "c1-15-a": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "[m]（哥哥……真的走了……）[/m]",
    "background": "dark_hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-15-a2"
  },
  "c1-15-a2": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "[m]（连最后一眼都不愿意看我吗……）[/m]",
    "background": "dark_hospital.png",
    "change_values": {
      "selfhate": {
        "add": 5
      }
    },
    "next": "c1-16"
  },
  "c1-15-b": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "[m]（好冷……可是，哥哥他……）[/m]",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-15-b2"
  },
  "c1-15-b2": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "[m]（明明就在旁边，却感觉那么远……）[/m]",
    "background": "hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-16"
  },
  "c1-16": {
    "name": "",
    "text": "时间一分一秒地流逝。[br]窗外的天色逐渐暗淡，病房内的光线也变得昏黄。",
    "background": "dark_hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-16.3"
  },
  "c1-16.3": {
    "name": "",
    "text": "影子在墙上拉长，[br]像某种不祥的预兆。",
    "background": "dark_hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-16.5"
  },
  "c1-16.5": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "[m]（房间里的氧气稀薄得让人窒息……）[/m]",
    "background": "dark_hospital.png",
    "next": "c1-16.7"
  },
  "c1-16.7": {
    "name": "Rice",
    "text": "[m]（那就干脆不呼吸好了……）[/m]",
